lines+=['',profiles['scope'],'',
'Numeric-state counts include each deployed method only. Local without communication omits ring links; communication includes them. The direct classifier needs no neural backbone. Optimizer state, transient workspace and Python container overhead are excluded. Ridge statistics are solved at inference; caching derived weights would add storage unless statistics were discarded after training. The all-candidate training runtime is not the cost of any single deployed model.','',
'## Protocol and audit','',
'- One development backbone, seed 540, stratified 50k fit / 10k validation from training images. Routing settings selected independently for six methods using validation all-class accuracy. Backbone learning rate fixed at 0.003 from the prior depth study.','- Ten fresh confirmation backbones: seeds 541–545, forward/reverse Split MNIST; all 60,000 training images and the full 10,000-image test set. Two passes over each current pair, batch 128, Adam, clip 5. No replay, pretraining or old-image visits after leaving a pair.','- Routing writes receive only current fixed keys and current pre-update branch indices. Class labels supervise the original neural loss and the direct classifier control. Task IDs and phase-end configurations never supervise routing memory. Boundaries construct the benchmark stream and diagnostic snapshots only.','- Every automatic prediction is produced without bank access; true test labels enter accuracy and snapshot-agreement diagnostics afterward. Model and association-memory checksums assert no test-time updates.','- Synthetic checks verify local activity retrieval, ridge equivalence to batch sufficient-statistics solutions, memory sizes and backbone derivatives. A separate no-sidecar replay verifies the first confirmation backbone is unchanged by auxiliary memory writes.','',
'## Reproducibility','',
'- [Driver](../../bdh_cl/scripts/online_proxy_branch_retrieval.py), [protocol](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/protocol.json), [all validation candidates](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/development.json), [selected settings](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/selection.json).','- [Confirmation results](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/results.json), [saved models](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/models), [association states](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/memories), [checks](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/verification.json), [backbone audit](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/backbone_audit.json).','- [Timing driver](../../bdh_cl/scripts/profile_online_proxy_retrieval.py), [CPU timing records](../../results/online_proxy_branch_retrieval_20261020/profile.json).','',
'## What this establishes','',
'Online input/activity associations can retrieve useful branches without a task ID or external historical route bank. This includes auxiliary memory and supervised training of the backbone. It does not establish that branches alone prevent forgetting, that neighbor communication is necessary, that the full rule is biologically local, or that the model outperforms simpler memory-based classifiers.']
